# ⚠️ FIXED: this list only covered the 6 hand-written static posts — any
# other /blog/<slug> (every AI-generated article, functions/api/ai-generate.js)
# matched NO rule here and fell through to the final SPA catch-all below,
# which serves the main app's index.html — not blog/index.html. That file has
# no blog-post view at all, so visitors, shared links, and search-engine
# crawlers landed on the homepage instead of the article. blog/index.html
# already handles direct /blog/:slug loads correctly (see its own init() at
# the bottom of that file) — it just never used to be reached for these URLs.
/blog/:slug /blog/index.html 200

